WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:04.970
This is a work of fiction.
Underage drinking is strongly prohibited and illegal.
Scenes involving alcohol with forceful consumption and shameful acts are not encouraged. Please view this as a comedy. Furthermore, all characters appearing in this work are of legal age.

00:05.804 --> 00:08.933
Hey, Kohei. It might just be my imagination but...

00:09.099 --> 00:10.768
What is it, Kitahara?

00:11.268 --> 00:14.063
The way they're looking at us is different.

00:14.230 --> 00:15.898
I thought so too.

00:16.440 --> 00:17.691
I wonder why.

00:17.858 --> 00:21.195
I don't know.
We're the same as we always are.

00:21.362 --> 00:24.156
Right? We're the same as we always are.

00:26.867 --> 00:28.827
Ask them what's wrong.

00:28.994 --> 00:32.665
-Me? You go ask them.
-No.

00:33.207 --> 00:36.710
They might reject us if we try talking to them.
That'd hurt.

00:37.169 --> 00:38.420
Oh, dear.

00:38.587 --> 00:40.089
Hey! Got a minute?

00:40.256 --> 00:41.924
Don't talk to us!

00:42.091 --> 00:43.842
We're going to kill you, jerk!

00:44.009 --> 00:46.845
I told you so.

00:47.012 --> 00:48.806
This is obviously strange!

00:49.348 --> 00:51.684
Nothing strange for a first-time introduction.

00:51.850 --> 00:55.562
What kind of terrible first-time introductions
have you experienced?

00:56.188 --> 00:58.399
Something must have happened.

00:58.565 --> 00:59.566
Like what?

00:59.733 --> 01:01.610
That's what I want to find out.

01:01.777 --> 01:04.113
But no one's going to talk to us.

01:04.280 --> 01:06.740
Why don't you ask Kotegawa?

01:06.907 --> 01:10.953
I can't. Not dressed like this.
She'd just glare at me.

01:11.120 --> 01:13.247
Yeah. Like you're a piece of trash.

01:13.414 --> 01:17.209
She's been in a bad mood
ever since the Izu Spring Festival.

